              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.19.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maraika yaagira abaamwemereire omumaisho ati: Mumujuure ebyo bijwaro bisiisikaire munonga. Kandi yaagira ati: Reeba, naakwihaho okutahikiirira kwawe, niinyija kukujweka ebijwaro birungi munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.29.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yob 29:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naanye naagira nti: Bamute ekikwemba kishemeire aha mutwe. Batyo baamuta ekikwemba kishemeire aha mutwe, baamujweka ebijwaro; obwo maraika wa MUKAMA ayemereire aho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
